# Except the vendored blume build. www depends on an unreleased upstream commit,
# so the tarball has to be in the repo for a fresh clone and CI to resolve it.
# The glob is deliberate: the filename carries the upstream SHA and changes on
# every re-cut. Delete this negation and the file when blume publishes a version
# above 1.4.2 carrying the #175 query-string fix. See www/package.json.
!www/vendor/
!www/vendor/*.tgz
.cargo-home/
